<p class="fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e"><strong>・Theory ∪ Practice・</strong>promote mutual dependency between theory and practice to drive research</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e"><strong>・Beyond Academia・</strong>collaborate with the relevant communities of practice</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p></div></div>
<div class="b" style="margin-left:3.47%;width:31.63%;margin-top:65px"><span id="comp-jmrcnnq7" class="anchor"></span><div class="rt"><h6 class="fs-23 c-27223e"><strong><em>Social relevance</em></strong></h6></div></div>
<div class="b" style="margin-left:3.47%;width:91.53%;margin-top:18px"><div class="rt"><p class="fs-14 c-27223e">[to be elaborated soon]</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e"><strong>・Inspire the community of practice・</strong>address authentic questions to produce relevant findings </p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e"><strong>・Innovate and transform music education・</strong>provide evidence–based arguments and support for curriculum design</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="fs-14 c-27223e"><strong>・Influence policy・</strong>transform research findings into recommendations for policy makers</p></div></div>
</div></section>
